{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <strong>SurvAIval</strong>, where survival meets automation! Gather resources, build your base, and bring it to life with the power of <strong>AI</strong>. Start small by crushing materials to earn money, but soon, your <strong>AI</strong> creations will handle the grind for you, freeing you to explore uncharted lands, conquer new territories, and forge alliances with those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your empire, meet the demands of new allies, and defend your base against relentless goblin raids. Will you rise as a master of automation and survival, or will the chaos of the world overtake you? The future of your base is in your hands!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather, collect, and manage resources efficiently.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create <strong>AI</strong>s to assist you in your survival journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your base from the ground up and defend it against threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas to explore and expand your domain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and upgrade your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set your own goals and forge your unique path to success. Achieve whatever you aspire to!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock New Characters</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_player_choose.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create AIs To Do Your Work</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_all_ai_details.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade Your AIs </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_gatherer_upg.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Base</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_build_your_base.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the World</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_explore_the_world.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Escape The Dungeon</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/spr_exit_dungeon.png?t=1741197705\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In Game Footage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/ai_worker.gif?t=1741197705\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/drop_coming.gif?t=1741197705\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/ai_upgrade.gif?t=1741197705\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/whip_using_fight.gif?t=1741197705\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/build_base.gif?t=1741197705\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391060/extras/kill_goblins.gif?t=1741197705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat The Goblin King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391060/648e7c2b02b0e740a1ad47bc60531c6144e2caf6.jpg"},{"name":"Mr. Fridge's Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391060/b5ae1e6926